        "date": "2026-11-08T14:27:24Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): the G-code viewer lists every line from the left edge\n\nadd_sized centred each program line in its row, and let a line wider\nthan the window wrap onto a second row that put every row below it off\nthe scroll cursor (#256). Each row is now a left-to-right box of the\nsame width and height; a wide line truncates on its row and shows in\nfull on hover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
